<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>상담 스크립트</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@supabase/supabase-js@2"></script>
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body.ceo-script-page {
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'Roboto', sans-serif;
            background: #0a0a0a;
            color: #ffffff;
            min-height: 100vh;
        }

        /* 아임웹 요소 스타일 보호 */
        body.ceo-script-page .modal-dialog,
        body.ceo-script-page .modal-content:not(.ceo-modal-content),
        body.ceo-script-page .modal-body,
        body.ceo-script-page .modal-header,
        body.ceo-script-page .modal-footer,
        body.ceo-script-page .form-control,
        body.ceo-script-page .btn,
        body.ceo-script-page [class*="imweb"],
        body.ceo-script-page [id*="imweb"],
        body.ceo-script-page input:not(.ceo-search-input),
        body.ceo-script-page select:not(.category-select),
        body.ceo-script-page textarea:not(.ceo-modal-textarea) {
            background: white !important;
            color: #333 !important;
            border-color: #ddd !important;
        }

        .ceo-script-container {
            max-width: 900px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 0;
        }

        .header {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a1a1a, #2a2a2a);
            padding: 24px;
            border-radius: 16px;
            border: 1px solid #333;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .header h1 {
            font-size: 24px;
            color: #ffffff;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
            text-align: left;
            padding: 0 0 20px 0;
        }

        .header h1 .user-name {
            color: #8b5cf6;
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        .tabs {
            display: flex;
            gap: 8px;
            width: 100%;
        }

        .tab-btn {
            flex: 1;
            padding: 12px 8px;
            border: 1px solid #333;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 500;
            cursor: pointer;
            background: transparent;
            color: #888;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 6px;
            text-align: center;
            min-height: 44px;
            white-space: nowrap;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .tab-btn.active {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #8b5cf6, #7c3aed);
            color: white;
            border-color: transparent;
        }
        
        /* 헤더 내 검색+카테고리 통합 스타일 */
        .header-controls {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 12px;
            margin-top: 16px;
        }
        
        .header-search-box {
            width: 100%;
            position: relative;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
        }
        
        .header-search-input {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 14px 40px 14px 40px;
            border: 1px solid #333;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-size: 16px;
            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
            color: white;
            font-weight: 400;
        }
        
        .header-search-input:focus {
            outline: none;
            border-color: #8b5cf6;
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.1);
        }
        
        .header-search-input::placeholder {
            color: #666;
        }
        
        .header-search-icon {
            position: absolute;
            left: 12px;
            color: #8b5cf6;
            z-index: 1;
        }
        
        .header-search-icon svg {
            width: 18px;
            height: 18px;
        }
        
        .header-clear-btn {
            position: absolute;
            right: 12px;
            background: none;
            border: none;
            color: #8b5cf6;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-size: 18px;
            padding: 4px;
            border-radius: 4px;
            display: none;
        }
        
        .header-clear-btn:hover {
            background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.1);
        }
        
        .header-category-select {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 14px 16px;
            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
            border: 1px solid #333;
            border-radius: 8px;
            color: white;
            font-size: 16px;
            cursor: pointer;
            appearance: none;
            background-image: url("data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg width='12' height='8' viewBox='0 0 12 8' fill='none' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%3E%3Cpath d='M1 1L6 6L11 1' stroke='%23888888' stroke-width='2' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'/%3E%3C/svg%3E");
            background-repeat: no-repeat;
            background-position: right 16px center;
            padding-right: 40px;
        }
        
        .header-category-select:hover,
        .header-category-select:focus {
            border-color: #8b5cf6;
            outline: none;
        }

        .ceo-search-box {
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            position: relative;
        }
        
        .ceo-search-input {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 18px 50px 18px 55px;
            border: 2px solid #333;
            border-radius: 16px;
            font-size: 18px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a1a1a, #2a2a2a);
            color: white;
            font-weight: 500;
        }

        .ceo-search-input:focus {
            outline: none;
            border-color: #8b5cf6;
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.15), 0 8px 24px rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.2);
            background: #1a1a1a;
        }

        .ceo-search-input::placeholder {
            color: #666;
            font-weight: 400;
        }

        .ceo-search-icon {
            position: absolute;
            left: 20px;
            top: 50%;
            transform: translateY(-50%);
            color: #8b5cf6;
        }
        
        .ceo-search-icon svg {
            width: 24px;
            height: 24px;
            display: block;
        }

        .ceo-clear-btn {
            position: absolute;
            right: 20px;
            top: 50%;
            transform: translateY(-50%);
            background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.1);
            border: none;
            color: #8b5cf6;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-size: 26px;
            padding: 6px 10px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            display: none;
            transition: all 0.2s;
        }

        .ceo-clear-btn:hover {
            background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.2);
        }

        .filter-section {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a1a1a, #2a2a2a);
            padding: 16px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
            border: 1px solid #333;
        }

        .filter-title {
            font-size: 17px;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #ffffff;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        .category-select {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 12px 16px;
            background: #0a0a0a;
            border: 1px solid #333;
            border-radius: 8px;
            color: white;
            font-size: 17px;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.2s;
            appearance: none;
            background-image: url("data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg width='12' height='8' viewBox='0 0 12 8' fill='none' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%3E%3Cpath d='M1 1L6 6L11 1' stroke='%23888888' stroke-width='2' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'/%3E%3C/svg%3E");
            background-repeat: no-repeat;
            background-position: right 16px center;
            padding-right: 40px;
        }

        .category-select:hover {
            border-color: #8b5cf6;
        }

        .category-select:focus {
            outline: none;
            border-color: #8b5cf6;
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.1);
        }

        .results-count {
            font-size: 16px;
            color: #666;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        .loading {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 40px;
            color: #666;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a1a1a, #2a2a2a);
            border-radius: 16px;
            border: 1px solid #333;
            font-size: 17px;
        }

        .skeleton {
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, #1a1a1a 25%, #2a2a2a 50%, #1a1a1a 75%);
            background-size: 200% 100%;
            animation: loading 1.5s infinite;
            border-radius: 8px;
            height: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        @keyframes loading {
            0% { background-position: 200% 0; }
            100% { background-position: -200% 0; }
        }

        .card {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a1a1a, #2a2a2a);
            border-radius: 16px;
            border: 1px solid #333;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
            overflow: hidden;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .card:hover {
            border-color: #8b5cf6;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.2);
        }

        .card-header {
            padding: 20px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: start;
        }

        .card-header-left {
            flex: 1;
        }

        .card-badges {
            display: flex;
            gap: 8px;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            align-items: center;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .badge {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 4px 10px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .badge-scene {
            background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.2);
            color: #a78bfa;
            border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.3);
        }

        .badge-category {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
            color: #888;
            border: 1px solid #333;
        }

        .card-question {
            font-size: 19px;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #ffffff;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }

        .expand-icon {
            color: #666;
            transition: all 0.3s;
            margin-left: 12px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
        }
        
        .expand-icon svg {
            width: 20px;
            height: 20px;
        }

        .card.expanded .expand-icon {
            transform: rotate(180deg);
            color: #8b5cf6;
        }

        .card-body {
            max-height: 0;
            overflow: hidden;
            transition: max-height 0.3s ease-out;
            padding: 0 20px;
        }

        .card.expanded .card-body {
            max-height: 2000px;
            padding: 0 20px 20px 20px;
        }

        .card-answer {
            color: #ccc;
            font-size: 17px;
            line-height: 1.7;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
            padding-top: 20px;
        }

        .card.expanded .card-answer {
            border-top: 1px solid #333;
        }

        .memo-box {
            background: rgba(234, 179, 8, 0.1);
            border: 1px solid rgba(234, 179, 8, 0.3);
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 12px;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            font-size: 16px;
            color: #fbbf24;
            display: flex;
            gap: 8px;
            align-items: start;
        }
        
        .memo-box svg {
            flex-shrink: 0;
            margin-top: 2px;
        }

        .keywords {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 6px;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        .keyword-tag {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
            color: #888;
            padding: 4px 10px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            font-size: 14px;
            border: 1px solid #333;
        }

        .card-actions {
            display: flex;
            gap: 8px;
            padding-top: 12px;
            border-top: 1px solid #333;
        }

        .ceo-btn {
            flex: 1;
            padding: 10px;
            border: 1px solid #333;
            border-radius: 10px;
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: 500;
            cursor: pointer;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 8px;
            background: transparent;
            color: #ccc;
        }
        
        .ceo-btn svg {
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }

        .ceo-btn-primary {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #8b5cf6, #7c3aed);
            color: white;
            border: none;
        }

        .ceo-btn-primary:hover {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #7c3aed, #6d28d9);
            color: white;
        }

        .ceo-btn-secondary {
            background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.1);
            color: #8b5cf6;
            border-color: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.3);
            flex: 0;
            padding: 10px 12px;
            position: relative;
        }
        
        .ceo-btn-secondary:hover::after {
            content: '나만의 메모';
            position: absolute;
            bottom: 100%;
            left: 50%;
            transform: translateX(-50%);
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            padding: 6px 12px;
            background: #1a1a1a;
            color: white;
            border: 1px solid #333;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-size: 13px;
            white-space: nowrap;
            z-index: 1000;
        }
        
        .ceo-btn-secondary svg {
            width: 19px;
            height: 19px;
        }

        .ceo-btn-tertiary {
            background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.1);
            color: #8b5cf6;
            border-color: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.3);
            flex: 0;
            padding: 10px 12px;
            position: relative;
        }

        .ceo-btn-tertiary:hover::after {
            content: '공유하기';
            position: absolute;
            bottom: 100%;
            left: 50%;
            transform: translateX(-50%);
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            padding: 6px 12px;
            background: #1a1a1a;
            color: white;
            border: 1px solid #333;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-size: 13px;
            white-space: nowrap;
            z-index: 1000;
        }
        
        .ceo-btn-tertiary svg {
            width: 19px;
            height: 19px;
        }

        .ceo-btn-tertiary:hover, .ceo-btn-secondary:hover {
            border-color: #8b5cf6;
            background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.2);
        }

        /* 버튼 그룹 (복사 + AI 답변) */
        .ceo-btn-group {
            flex: 1;
            display: flex;
            gap: 4px;
        }
        
        .ceo-btn-half {
            flex: 1;
            font-size: 14px;
            padding: 10px 8px;
        }
        
        .ceo-btn-ai {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #6366f1, #4f46e5);
            border: none;
        }
        
        .ceo-btn-ai:hover {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #4f46e5, #4338ca);
            color: white;
        }

        .heart-btn {
            background: none;
            border: none;
            cursor: pointer;
            padding: 4px;
            transition: all 0.2s;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
        }
        
        .heart-btn svg {
            width: 24px;
            height: 24px;
        }

        .heart-btn:hover {
            transform: scale(1.1);
        }

        .ceo-modal {
            display: none;
            position: fixed;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            right: 0;
            bottom: 0;
            background: rgba(0,0,0,0.8);
            z-index: 99999;
            padding: 20px;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
        }

        .ceo-modal.active {
            display: flex;
        }

        .ceo-modal-content {
            background: #1a1a1a;
            border: 1px solid #333;
            border-radius: 16px;
            padding: 24px;
            max-width: 500px;
            width: 100%;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
            z-index: 100000;
            position: relative;
        }

        .ceo-modal-title {
            font-size: 22px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #ffffff;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
        }

        .ceo-modal-textarea {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 12px;
            border: 1px solid #333;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-size: 17px;
            font-family: inherit;
            resize: vertical;
            min-height: 120px;
            background: #0a0a0a;
            color: white;
        }

        .ceo-modal-textarea:focus {
            outline: none;
            border-color: #8b5cf6;
        }

        .ceo-modal-actions {
            display: flex;
            gap: 12px;
            margin-top: 16px;
        }
        
        .ceo-modal-actions .ceo-btn-primary {
            flex: 6;
        }
        
        .ceo-modal-actions .ceo-btn-tertiary {
            flex: 4;
        }

        .no-results {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 60px 20px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a1a1a, #2a2a2a);
            border-radius: 16px;
            border: 1px solid #333;
            font-size: 18px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="ceo-script-page">
    <div class="ceo-script-container">
        <div class="header">
            <h1><span class="user-name" id="user-name-display">사용자</span>님을 위한 상담 스크립트</h1>
            
            <div class="tabs">
                <button class="tab-btn active" data-tab="all">
                    <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                        <path d="M3 9l9-7 9 7v11a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2z"></path>
                    </svg>
                    전체
                </button>
                <button class="tab-btn" data-tab="favorites">
                    <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                        <path d="M19 21l-7-5-7 5V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h10a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z"></path>
                    </svg>
                    저장 <span id="fav-count">0</span>
                </button>
                <button class="tab-btn" data-tab="memos">
                    <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                        <path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"></path>
                        <polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"></polyline>
                        <line x1="16" y1="13" x2="8" y2="13"></line>
                        <line x1="16" y1="17" x2="8" y2="17"></line>
                        <polyline points="10 9 9 9 8 9"></polyline>
                    </svg>
                    메모 <span id="memo-count">0</span>
                </button>
            </div>
            
            <!-- 헤더 내 검색 + 카테고리 통합 -->
            <div class="header-controls">
                <div class="header-search-box">
                    <span class="header-search-icon">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                            <circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"></circle>
                            <path d="m21 21-4.35-4.35"></path>
                        </svg>
                    </span>
                    <input type="text" id="search-input" class="header-search-input" placeholder="검색...">
                    <button class="header-clear-btn" id="clear-search">×</button>
                </div>
                <select class="header-category-select" id="category-select">
                    <option value="전체">전체</option>
                </select>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="results-count" id="results-count">⚡ 데이터를 빠르게 불러오는 중...</div>
        
        <div id="loading" class="loading">
            <div class="skeleton" style="width: 80%;"></div>
            <div class="skeleton" style="width: 60%;"></div>
            <div class="skeleton" style="width: 90%;"></div>
        </div>
        
        <div id="cards-container"></div>
        
        <div class="no-results" id="no-results" style="display:none;">
            <svg width="64" height="64" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#333" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="margin: 0 auto 16px;">
                <circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"></circle>
                <path d="m21 21-4.35-4.35"></path>
            </svg>
            <div style="color:#666;font-size:15px;">검색 결과가 없습니다</div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="ceo-modal" id="memo-modal">
        <div class="ceo-modal-content">
            <div class="ceo-modal-title">메모 작성</div>
            <textarea class="ceo-modal-textarea" id="memo-textarea" placeholder="이 화법에 대한 메모를 작성하세요..."></textarea>
            <div class="ceo-modal-actions">
                <button class="ceo-btn ceo-btn-primary" id="save-memo">저장</button>
                <button class="ceo-btn ceo-btn-tertiary" id="cancel-memo">취소</button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <script>
        // ✅ IIFE로 스코프 격리 - IMWEB 중복 로드 방지
